WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
Saved posts are easy to collect — and surprisingly hard to use.

00:03.600 --> 00:09.200
Unstash imports your official Reddit saved-post CSV, right in the browser.

00:09.200 --> 00:13.800
No Reddit login. No OAuth token. Nothing gets uploaded.

00:13.800 --> 00:19.400
Pick an action. Search your queue. Finish an item. Then export to Markdown.

00:19.400 --> 00:24.000
The CSV importer is live. Next: a lightweight browser extension.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.000
Open source, private by default, and ready to try.
